    "1657348293dc4e4fd8": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "165734829349367447-0": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Prayer Booth: Your Sanctuary for Peaceful Worship"
          }
        },
        "165734829349367447-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p>Introducing our soundproof Prayer Booth, designed specifically for peaceful, focus-driven worship environments. This prayer pod creates a quiet sanctuary perfect for personal reflection and prayer in any setting.</p><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul><li><strong>Optimised for Worship</strong>: Our Prayer Booth provides a serene, distraction-free space, ideal for private prayer and reflection.</li><li><strong>Spacious Design</strong>: Comfortably accommodates individuals for personal worship, ensuring a peaceful and private atmosphere.</li><li><strong>Advanced Ventilation</strong>: Equipped with a new industry-leading dual silent ventilation system, keeping the space well-aired, cool, and comfortable with minimal acoustic interference.</li><li><strong>Durable Construction</strong>: Made from  full toughened glass and internal PET acoustic panels, ensuring durability and longevity.</li><li><strong>Soundproofing Excellence</strong>: Engineered to minimise internal and external noise, creating a quiet environment for focused worship.</li></ul><h3>Why Choose Our Prayer Booth?</h3><ul><li><strong>Soundproof Prayer Pods for Peaceful Worship</strong>: Perfect for offices, educational institutions, airports, and health industry facilities.</li><li><strong>No Furniture Needed</strong>: Simplistic design with no seats or tables, allowing you to customise your prayer experience.</li><li><strong>Versatile Use</strong>: Suitable for personal prayer, creating an office prayer room, or setting up a dedicated praying corner.</li></ul><p>Experience the tranquillity of our Prayer Booth from Soundbox Store, crafted to provide a dedicated space for uninterrupted worship. Whether you're setting up a prayer room in an office, an educational institution, or a serene praying corner in an airport or healthcare facility, our soundproof design ensures peace and focus.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "165734829349367447-0",
        "165734829349367447-1"
      ],
