    "d860300d-7c49-4055-87c4-01913a46c1c6": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "template--16505126420705__d860300d-7c49-4055-87c4-01913a46c1c6-question-1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is the Folio Phone Booth suitable for video conferencing and Zoom calls?",
            "text": "<p>Yes. The Folio Phone Booth is designed to provide a quiet and distraction-free environment, making it perfect for video conferences and Zoom calls. The soundproofing ensures that your conversations remain confidential, and the ergonomic design ensures comfort during extended calls.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--16505126420705__d860300d-7c49-4055-87c4-01913a46c1c6-question-2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I customise the lighting and power options in the Folio Phone Booth?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, you can. The Folio Phone Booth features a directional task lighting bar and offers multiple power options, including USB and USB-C ports. The lighting is dimmable, allowing you to adjust it to your preferred level, and an energy-saving motion sensor control enhances convenience.</p>"
          }
        },
        "62d5b51a-c8c9-429f-a5ee-39d7beb372e3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What makes the Folio Phone Booth environmentally friendly?",
            "text": "<p>Sustainability is acore aspect of the Folio Phone Booth's design. It incorporates recycled materials, with each booth containing approximately ≥180kg of recycled materials per 12m²/0.66m³. The booth also boasts a remarkably low carbon footprint of ≤0.071kg CO2e and minimal energy consumption of ≤0.4MJ, aligning with our commitment to eco-conscious design.</p>"
          }
        },
        "179bc003-ecfe-4d1e-92ab-394998b9c663": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Power supply set up, do we need to do any thing?",
            "text": "<p>No all our booths come with a 13amp power supply which plugs into the side of the booth with standard insert. Plug into your wall socket with locally supplied wall plug. If you are purchasing in UK, Europe or the US you will be supplied with local wall socket and correct electrical certificated components CE / UL Certificated</p>"
          }
        }
      },
